            Gets whether the application is executing on a Win32 operating system
            </summary>
            <remarks>此方法是线程安全的。</remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="P:ClearCanvas.Common.Platform.IsUnixPlatform">
            <summary>
            Gets whether the application is executing on Mac, Linux, or other Unix-like operating systems
            </summary>
            <remarks>
            This method is thread-safe.
            </remarks>
        </member>
        <member name="P:ClearCanvas.Common.Platform.PathSeparator">
